WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.438 --> 00:00:03.621
Unit seventeen. My School!

2
00:00:04.545 --> 00:00:12.872
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Beginner level!

3
00:00:12.922 --> 00:00:17.577
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.627 --> 00:00:20.433
Today we learn: My School. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.207 --> 00:00:25.241
School. Say it with me. School!

6
00:00:28.662 --> 00:00:32.262
Classroom. Say it with me. Classroom!

7
00:00:35.759 --> 00:00:39.309
Teacher. Say it with me. Teacher!

8
00:00:42.812 --> 00:00:46.746
Student. Say it with me. Student!

9
00:00:50.236 --> 00:00:53.686
Desk. Say it with me. Desk!

10
00:00:57.239 --> 00:01:00.506
Book. Say it with me. Book!

11
00:01:03.966 --> 00:01:07.366
Pencil. Say it with me. Pencil!

12
00:01:10.857 --> 00:01:14.207
Learn. Say it with me. Learn!

13
00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:27.043
Grammar time! There is or are. Listen. There is a teacher. There are many students.

14
00:01:27.093 --> 00:01:33.167
Your turn. Say it with me. There is a teacher. There are many students.

15
00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:48.435
I go to school every day. My classroom has many desks and books. My teacher helps all the students learn. I bring a pencil and a book to class.

16
00:01:48.485 --> 00:01:49.946
I like this story!

17
00:01:50.937 --> 00:01:56.169
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:56.219 --> 00:01:57.369
Teacher!

19
00:01:58.267 --> 00:02:03.490
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:04.690
Pencil!

21
00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:13.435
Think and answer. What do you like about your school?

22
00:02:13.485 --> 00:02:14.642
Great answer!

23
00:02:15.891 --> 00:02:18.673
This unit's value is Curiosity.

24
00:02:18.723 --> 00:02:21.198
I can show curiosity every day!

25
00:02:21.951 --> 00:02:26.331
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:26.381 --> 00:02:27.973
Goodbye, everyone!

